Access to eye specialists is uneven, so we brought the first screening to the
device most people already carry.

## The problem

Diabetic retinopathy is treatable when caught early — but early is exactly when
most people never get screened, because a specialist visit is out of reach.

## What we built

A phone-camera screening flow backed by Azure Vision that flags signs of
diabetic eye disease, plus a chatbot that helps people understand results and
next steps in plain language.

## Results

Peaky Blinder took runner-up and the Audience Award at COMPFEST's AI Innovation
Challenge 2024 and reached the Gemastik national finals.
